 of the\ngltch.cbr><br>Under the Responses Folder, it shows an Inactivation Date of 3/4/96 by Consumer Relations\n(BRC D66).<brocbr>Under the Club Folder, it shows Status as Inactivatod on 314/96, but then shows a Card\nIssue Date of 11/5/96.<br>-<br>Under the Mailings Folder, it shows @ TWR Welcome Mailing as of\n11/5196.<br>-<br>Bottom line is i she was inactivated on 3/4/86, why was sho sont a mombership card and\n\u2018welcome mailing on 11/5/96, and that\u2019s what wo'e trying to decipher and get corrected.<br><br>This isthe\n\u2018seventh consumer that has been referred to me with a similar situation, and by cc/ | want to alert everyone to\nwhat's happening. Pis have any similar cases referred to me, so that we can check into it\nturther.cbr>ebreWhat | would suggest is that you send a calendar trom here, and also an Inside NASCAR\nmagazine when we get them, and | will put a Continuity oer and race schedule in your mail box for her. The\nproblemis how to get a 1997 membership card to these consumers, and tm working on that\nalso.<br><br>Hope this helps, and pls let me know if you need anything further. Thanks. <br><br> ~\n<broFrom: Joyce, Traci S.cbr>To: Reese, Bonnie L.<br>Subject: SDB Case Referral - CHARLOTTE\nDiCKcbr>Date: Tuesday, February 18, 1997 1:25PMcbr><brsName CHARLOTTE\nDiCKebr><brsPID # 1170392752<br><braContact #_ : 0 THIS CONSUMER HAS BEEN\nINACTIVATED.WHY? CONSUMER CALLED REQ CALENDAR ETC. PLEASE LET ME KNOW.\n<biocbr> Case # tebro<bi> THANKS, TRACIcbr>\n\u2018&itBitFile Attachment; SDBDATA SDBEgL89t;<br>-<br>cbr><br></body><ihtmi>\n\n16eZ 6162s\n\n10423084059", "words": [{"text": "RJRO0000O!", "x0": 12, "y0": 954, "x1": 85, "y1": 966, "conf": 63.0}, {"text": "70032", "x0": 12, "y0": 972, "x1": 50, "y1": 984, "conf": 82.0}, {"text": "5856", "x0": 55, "y0": 972, "x1": 85, "y1": 984, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "<htmb>", "x0": 89, "y0": 89, "x1": 122, "y1": 97, "conf": 22.0}, {"text": "<head>", "x0": 89, "y0": 103, "x1": 126, "y1": 112, "conf": 69.0